Housekeeping commands for K8s: on Master node
 
Below command will remove "Terminating" pods in all namespaces:
kubectl get pods --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true --all-namespaces | grep Terminating | while read namespace pod rest; do kubectl --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true delete pod $pod -n $namespace; done
 
Below command will remove "ContainerStatusUnknown" pods in all namespaces:
kubectl get pods --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true --all-namespaces | grep ContainerStatusUnknown | while read namespace pod rest; do kubectl --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true delete pod $pod -n $namespace --grace-period=0 --force; done
 
Below command will remove "CrashLoopBackOff" pods in all namespaces:
kubectl get pods --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true --all-namespaces | grep CrashLoopBackOff | while read namespace pod rest; do kubectl --insecure-skip-tls-verify=true delete pod $pod -n $namespace --grace-period=0 --force; done
 
